{"id":227,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"People fashion swords from Skarmory’s shed feathers, so this Pokémon is a popular element in heraldic designs."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"The pointed feathers of these Pokémon are sharper than swords. Skarmory and Corviknight fight viciously over territory."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its body is draped in steel armor. It looks heavy, but it can fly at speeds of up to 185 miles an hour!"},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"The wing feathers it sheds can be processed and made into knives whose sharpness is recognized by the finest chefs."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Its metal body is sturdy, but it does rust rather easily. So on rainy days, this Pokémon prefers to stay put in its nest."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its feathers, which fall off as it grows, are thin and sharp. In times long past, warriors used them as swords."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Skarmory’s steel wings become tattered and bashed in from repeated battles. Once a year, the battered wings grow back completely, restoring the cutting edges to their pristine state."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Skarmory is entirely encased in hard, protective armor. This Pokémon flies at close to 190 mph. It slashes foes with its wings that possess swordlike cutting edges."},{"games":["Y","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Despite being clad entirely in iron-hard armor, it flies at speeds over 180 mph."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"After nesting in bramble bushes, the wings of its chicks grow hard from scratches by thorns."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Its heavy-looking iron body is actually thin and light, so it can fly at speeds over 180 mph."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Its sturdy wings look heavy, but they are actually hollow and light, allowing it to fly freely in the sky."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"Its sturdy wings look heavy, but its bones are hollow and light, allowing it to fly freely in the sky."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A POKéMON that has a body and wings of steel. People in the past used feathers fallen from SKARMORY to make swords and knives."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"The feathers that it sheds are very sharp. It is said that people once used the feathers as swords."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Keen Eye","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's keen eyes prevent its accuracy from being lowered."},{"name":"Sturdy","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon cannot be knocked out by a single hit as long as its HP is full. One-hit KO moves will also fail to knock it out."},{"name":"Weak Armor","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's Defense stat is lowered when it takes damage from physical moves, but its Speed stat is sharply boosted."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Gray","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":227,"name":"Skarmory","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,43],[1,64],[4,28],[8,31],[12,232],[16,97],[20,17],[24,163],[28,211],[32,371],[36,65],[40,319],[44,191],[48,334],[52,413]],"machine":[332,97,314,403,776,413,174,399,529,814,203,263,430,19,416,542,63,196,334,442,232,319,182,156,179,46,157,317,328,201,214,191,446,796,164,241,129,14,366,36,269,851,168,404],"egg":[314,174,364,400,355,143,18],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv8-209","name":"Skarmory","set":"Surging Sparks","date":"2024-11-08","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"209","artist":null,"img":"sv8/209"},{"id":"me5-60","name":"Skarmory","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity":"Common","number":"60","artist":"Anesaki Dynamic","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-60/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-60/large"},{"id":"me3-55","name":"Mega Skarmory ex","set":"Perfect Order","date":"2026-03-27","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"55","artist":null,"small":"https://images.s